# Session: 2026-05-12

**Started:** ~10:50 UTC (resumed from 2026-05-12 morning save) — Director returned active around 15:52 UTC
**Last Updated:** 2026-05-12 ~17:27 UTC
**Project:** SandyStudio webapp — Mode 2.5 Prod Assistant + Mode 3 readiness
**Topic:** Mode 3 readiness drill — Director ran full E20 episode pipeline through Writer→Story Editor; surfaced and fixed 14 chained bugs; merged PR #23 to master; closed Writer↔Story Editor internal loop.

---

## What We Are Building

**SandyStudio** is an AI-first animation production studio. Today's session focused on **Mode 2.5 Prod Assistant** (conversational agent in webapp right-panel that drives the pipeline by voice/text) and **Mode 3 readiness drill** — the multi-agent pipeline should self-iterate (Writer → Story Editor → if REVISE, back to Writer → if PASS, advance to Storyboard) without Director seeing intermediate bad drafts.

Director's role is flight instructor drawing the route; PA + studio agents are the flight crew flying the plane. Today validated that the loop can converge: Writer v01 had issues → revision → Writer v02 (still issues — found bugs) → multiple fixes → Writer v03 passed all 8 acceptance criteria (11 units, 60s runtime, durations ≤7s, etc).

PR #23 packaged everything — Mode 2.5 Phase 1-A + 1-B + Phase A (gpt-5.5 + BEHAVIOR_CONTRACT) + Mode 3 readiness drill — and merged to master at 17:22 UTC.

